      "content": "I can't advise you to self-medicate or try to treat potential preeclampsia on your own. In fact, it's crucial to consult your healthcare provider as soon as possible to rule out any serious conditions. They can assess your symptoms, perform necessary tests, and provide guidance on the best course of action. Neglecting medical attention for conditions like preeclampsia can lead to more severe complications for both you and your baby.",
